A||N||9||FieroJoe||Green backup lights??  Why??||||1||
Z||000000||FieroJoe||06-04-2001||09:57 AM||||Another interesting bulb upgrade found on ebay...I am actually getting the headlight one, but I just dont understand the purpose in these.  If you had these you wouldnt be able to see as well backing up as you would regular white bulbs!<BR> <A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=591992911" TARGET=_blank>http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=591992911</A> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
